("PregnancyUK-1x4qtgl","pgh00ua","expecting_mother","second_trimester","tried_failed",["books","diet_rules","rules_overload"],"In \"expecting better\" the author looks at lots of evidence and studies to explain where are pregnancy rules come from and the facts behind them. I read this early on in my pregnancy to understand what I was facing.","UK author planning one small glass at a Michelin dinner; defends herself with a book she read early.","restricted conservatively: alcohol in pregnancy in the same thread"),
("PregnancyUK-1x4qtgl","pgfz1bn","expecting_mother","second_trimester","pain",["unwanted_advice","diet_rules"],"honestly a bit surprised at the amount of judgement on this post which is a bit of a shame","Same author, after 110 comments on her wine question.","restricted conservatively: alcohol in pregnancy in the same thread"),
("PregnancyUK-1x4qtgl","pgheqc7","expecting_mother","second_trimester","belief",["rules_overload","diet_rules","contrary_evidence"],"Our days are filled with hundreds of risks we must consider and calculate. Pregnancy is a crazy and wild thing we undertake and my ask to you is to show some grace to those on this journey, weighing, calculating, deciding, mitigating and taking these risks.","Same author closing her argument with a commenter.","restricted conservatively: alcohol in pregnancy in the same thread"),
