("pregnant-1x4rj1w","pgg5jea","expecting_mother","third_trimester","pain",["country_difference","who_to_ask"],"There’s no portal so I can try to call and ask for the notes. It’s very difficult to get in touch with doctors here because they work in a different hospital every day and don’t have staff","Same author on getting information after the scan."),
("PregnancyUK-1x4rjw7",None,"expecting_mother","third_trimester","pain",["visitors","first_two_weeks","mother_in_law","culture"],"My husband comes from a culture where visiting the sick and a new baby is seen as a community obligation, so there would be lots of people wanting to come.","Due within three weeks, first grandchild both sides; lives in her husband's town in a 2-bed flat."),
("PregnancyUK-1x4rjw7",None,"expecting_mother","third_trimester","others_said",["visitors","mother_in_law","first_two_weeks"],"we can pass the baby round to anyone who wants to hold for no more than 30 secs. She said she would act as our personal body guard and make sure nobody expects too much, kisses the baby or comes while unwell.","Same author describing her mother-in-law's plan: a family gathering at her house in week one or two."),
("PregnancyUK-1x4rjw7",None,"expecting_mother","third_trimester","pain",["visitors","partner_role","first_two_weeks","postpartum_recovery"],"Initially my husband thought it was a great idea and suggested planning it within the first week post birth!!! I had to remind him that I will be bleeding, learning breast feeding and probably struggling with the baby blues.","Same author on her husband's first reaction.","restricted conservatively: postpartum bleeding and mood wording"),
("PregnancyUK-1x4rjw7",None,"expecting_mother","third_trimester","pain",["visitors","first_two_weeks"],"But even the thought of locking in a family event at 2 weeks just feels too much pressure to me. My husband really wants his family to meet the baby and share the excitement but I just feel overwhelmed.","Same author, after her husband agreed to text 'no visitors to our flat'."),
